    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Sanctified Forge Initiate.</strong> You are licensed by the Great Work to hit things until they get better.</p><ul><li>You gain skill rank with <strong>the Plating aptitude</strong> and the <strong>Faith (Soul)</strong> skill (handled by the Soul-Smith class traits).</li><li>On the campaign layer, when you are physically present in a hex that has structural damage, environmental ruin, or infrastructure loss, your faction may spend <strong>Economy OP</strong> to <strong>repair or stabilize</strong> that hex more efficiently, with you as the narrative focus.</li></ul><p>The exact mechanical effect is governed by your hex repair rules, but this feature marks you as a Bad Eden-specific repair engine keyed off Economy OP.</p>",
